  briefingSystemLine: 'Proposal: Unit No. 11S proceed to combat simulation 01.'
  briefingDialogue:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Good morning, 11S. I'm Operator 17O. I'll be monitoring your certification.
  - speaker: 0
    text: Your targets are machine lifeforms, reconstructed from archived combat data.
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Report: Pod 217 online. Assigned to support Unit 11S.'
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Proposal: Destroy targets to charge Pod Program: Laser.'
  - speaker: 0
    text: The Commander reads these logs, so no pressure.
  debriefSystemLine: 'Analysis: Simulation 01 cleared. Combat parameters within tolerance.'
  debriefDialogue:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Nice work, 11S. Your reaction time is above the unit average.
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...I wasn't supposed to tell you that.
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Report: Operator 17O has disclosed restricted evaluation data. Logging.'
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...Pod, you don't have to log everything.
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Correction: Pod 217 is required to log everything.'
  failureTitle: 
  failureSystemLine: 
  failureDialogue:
  - speaker: 0
    text: Don't worry. Nobody passes on the first try.
  - speaker: 0
    text: ...Almost nobody.
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'Proposal: Retry.'
  failureMenuLabel: 
